	)
	(text "Orientation: The Molex 54548-2271 is a right-angle connector with bottom contacts, which is the standard used on official Raspberry Pi boards and works with off-the-shelf camera FFC cables.\nZIF/LIF: These are typically Zero Insertion Force (ZIF) or Low Insertion Force (LIF) connectors, which have a flap or slider mechanism to secure the FFC cable.\nCable Type: Ensure you use a standard A-type FFC cable (contacts on the same side of the stiffener as the insertion end) if you select a \"bottom contact\" connector. The standard Raspberry Pi cables are this type. "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.304 30.226 0)
		(effects
